{"info":{"title":"Nanatsu-iro★Drops","originalTitle":"Nanatsu-iro★Drops","synopsis":"Tsuwabaki Masaharu, uno studente come tanti, un giorno scambia accidentalmente la sua bevanda con quella di un uomo con delle strane orecchie da cane. A causa di quella bevanda ogni notte il ragazzo si trasforma in una piccola e morbida pecorella; la sua unica speranza per tornare normale è che una ragazza prescelta trovi e catturi con la sua bacchetta sette \"gocce delle stelle\". La ragazza prescelta è la sua compagna di classe Kihime Sumomo, ma attenzione: se la ragazza scoprisse la vera identità della pecorella il povero Masaharu sarebbe costretto a rimanere in quello stato per sempre!","type":"series","status":"completed","statusLabel":"Finito","audio":"Giapponese","dubbed":false,"releaseDateLabel":"03 Luglio 2007","year":2007,"season":"Estate 2007","studios":["Diomedea"],"genres":["Magia","Romantico","Scolastico","Sentimentale"],"durationLabel":"24 min/ep","declaredEpisodeCount":12,"availableEpisodeCount":12,"rating":7.91,"ratingCount":22,"views":6045,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oUPNNyLmJWQX2xqvLnFgwKpmrwk.jpg","shareImage":{"base":"img","path":"/locandine/18007l.jpg"},"sourceType":"Anime","tags":["Anime","Finito","2007"],"extra":{"ids":{"anilistIds":[1688],"malIds":[1688],"anidbIds":[4884],"imdbMovieIds":[],"imdbShowIds":[],"tmdbMovieIds":[],"tmdbShowIds":[92573],"tvdbMovieIds":[],"tvdbShowIds":[84027]},"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-11-02T08:43:20Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:1688","mal:1688"],"imdbSource":"plexanibridge-v2","targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4884","scope":"R","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1688","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"1688","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"92573","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"84027","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}}]},"metadataTargets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4884","scope":"R","raw":"anidb:4884:R","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1688","raw":"anilist:1688","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"1688","raw":"mal:1688","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"92573","scope":"s1","raw":"tmdb_show:92573:s1","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"84027","scope":"s1","raw":"tvdb_show:84027:s1","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}}],"imdbId":"tt1132208","sourceIds":{"anilist":1688,"mal":1688},"tmdb":{"source":"tmdb-api","id":92573,"type":"tv","sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/92573","fetchedAt":"2026-11-02T19:57:30.493Z","originalLanguage":"ja-JP","title":{"value":"Nanatsu-iro Drops: First Love That Encompasses You","language":"en-US"},"originalTitle":"ななついろ★ドロップス First love that encompasses you","overview":{"value":"* Based on an adult visual novel by UNiSONSHIFT.\n\nWhat if, when watching the stars outside the window...\n\nWhat if, when writing in your secret diary at the end if the day...\n\n...A mysterious light suddenly falls from the sky...\n\nTsuwabuki Masaharu, or Haru as his friends like to call him, is your normal middle school student. Now in his second year, his friends push him to speak with his classmates whom he has yet to speak to, but this was still difficult for Haru due to his clumsy nature.\n\nOne afternoon, his life met with a 180° turn during a strange encounter in the hallways of Hoshigaoka School. During that fateful encounter, he accidentally drank a magical potion which makes him transform into a stuffed animal sheep during the night!\n\nHaru later learns that in order to return to his original self, he needs to collect \"star droplets\" that fall from the sky. However, being that his innards are now made of cotton, he will need the help of a \"special person.\" Little did he know that the special person was someone from his class.\n\nLiving a double life between his day-self and his sheep form \"Yuki-chan,\" page one of his story, her story, and the story of nanatsuiro drops begins...","language":"en-US"},"startDate":"2007-07-03","endDate":"2007-09-18","status":"Ended","rating":8.5,"ratingCount":2,"numberOfEpisodes":12,"numberOfSeasons":1,"genres":["Animazione","Commedia"],"countries":["Japan"],"facts":{"Runtime":"25m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[{"id":94,"name":"MBS","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7RNXnyiMbjgqtPAjja13wchcrGI.png"}],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":1221026,"name":"Hirofumi Nojima","role":"Masaharu Tsuwabuki (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sKj8nGVxv4hci3xuZgiFYPZvaX5.jpg"},{"id":1247897,"name":"Michiru Yuimoto","role":"Sumomo Akihime (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xxqDD6kE27mJujc9wrwofDZC2ns.jpg"},{"id":1222100,"name":"Kaori Shimizu","role":"Nadeshiko Yaeno (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/p5A7efRBlhmhtdyfbpmjJgeUkhq.jpg"},{"id":89968,"name":"Kazuhiko Inoue","role":"Seishirou Akihime (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3BpYtYRiLAmTNbCm2LXlXnkMRit.jpg"},{"id":1574946,"name":"Mai Gotou","role":"Yuki-chan (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/b2jS4McUsMLd3SUDX1dtD25stGm.jpg"},{"id":224413,"name":"Satoshi Hino","role":"Sakuraba Keisuke (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8ZJIiwIVF2zDyyFr7oXewj0eEuu.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"en-US","title":"Nanatsu-iro Drops: First Love That Encompasses You","overview":"* Based on an adult visual novel by UNiSONSHIFT.\n\nWhat if, when watching the stars outside the window...\n\nWhat if, when writing in your secret diary at the end if the day...\n\n...A mysterious light suddenly falls from the sky...\n\nTsuwabuki Masaharu, or Haru as his friends like to call him, is your normal middle school student. Now in his second year, his friends push him to speak with his classmates whom he has yet to speak to, but this was still difficult for Haru due to his clumsy nature.\n\nOne afternoon, his life met with a 180° turn during a strange encounter in the hallways of Hoshigaoka School. During that fateful encounter, he accidentally drank a magical potion which makes him transform into a stuffed animal sheep during the night!\n\nHaru later learns that in order to return to his original self, he needs to collect \"star droplets\" that fall from the sky. However, being that his innards are now made of cotton, he will need the help of a \"special person.\" Little did he know that the special person was someone from his class.\n\nLiving a double life between his day-self and his sheep form \"Yuki-chan,\" page one of his story, her story, and the story of nanatsuiro drops begins..."},{"language":"ja-JP","title":"ななついろ★ドロップス","overview":"たとえば、窓の外の星を見つめているとき。たとえば、一日のおわりに秘密の日記を書いているとき。\n\n不思議な出来事は突然空から降ってくる――。\n\n騒がしい街には、電車で数駅。\n\nほんのちょっと不便だけれど、静かで展望台があって、流れ星がたくさん見える・・・\n\nそんな町、舞方市星ケ丘。ここは『世界で一番星に近い町』と呼ばれている。\n\nそんな星ケ丘にひとつだけある学校「星城学園」に通う石蕗正晴（つわぶきまさはる）は、\n\n少しだけ不器用 だけど、どこにでもいる普通の男の子。\n\n学年も変わって新しくなったクラスで今まで一度も話したことのな かった同級生たちと話すことは、\n\n不器用な正晴には少し難しいことだった。\n\n五月のある日――正晴の生活は１８０度変わってしまう。\n\nあるハプニングから飲んだ怪しいジュースのせいで、正晴は日が暮れると\n\n小さな羊のぬいぐるみになってしまうのだった！！\n\n元に戻れる手段がただ一つ。この町に流れ星とともに降ってくる『星のしずく』を集めること。\n\nそして『星のしずく』を集めることができるのは、不思議な杖に選ばれた、特別な女の子――。\n\nその「特別な女の子」とは、クラスメイトの秋姫すももだった・・・。\n\n今まで話したこともなかったクラスメイト。だけど正体を知られたら、永遠に普通の人間には戻れない。\n\n昼間は不器用な男の子「石蕗正晴」として。そして夜になれば羊のぬいぐるみ「ユキちゃん」として。\n\n不思議な物語の一ページが、いま始まる――。"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yCAvQEbVe4HhWS61M6SQJwv3x0F.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yCAvQEbVe4HhWS61M6SQJwv3x0F.png","language":"ja","width":673,"height":306}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oUPNNyLmJWQX2xqvLnFgwKpmrwk.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oUPNNyLmJWQX2xqvLnFgwKpmrwk.jpg","language":"xx","width":980,"height":1400},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bsbFm1KhxxzeF9hgCZ1EuX7ENdl.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bsbFm1KhxxzeF9hgCZ1EuX7ENdl.jpg","language":"xx","width":1000,"height":1500}],"backdrops":[{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gT8chbPDLs6muGNmVUsIaxbOxsU.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gT8chbPDLs6muGNmVUsIaxbOxsU.jpg","language":"xx","width":1280,"height":720},{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/t1x7M8vWeSc7Sm8GXrkjSmt1f5D.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/t1x7M8vWeSc7Sm8GXrkjSmt1f5D.jpg","language":"xx","width":1920,"height":1080},{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sAyyQSzrG8i3941uEnvs713Im9Q.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sAyyQSzrG8i3941uEnvs713Im9Q.jpg","language":"xx","width":1280,"height":720}]},"logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yCAvQEbVe4HhWS61M6SQJwv3x0F.png","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oUPNNyLmJWQX2xqvLnFgwKpmrwk.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gT8chbPDLs6muGNmVUsIaxbOxsU.jpg","seasons":[{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2007,"episodeCount":12,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oUPNNyLmJWQX2xqvLnFgwKpmrwk.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/92573/season/1"}],"schema":{}}},"background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gT8chbPDLs6muGNmVUsIaxbOxsU.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yCAvQEbVe4HhWS61M6SQJwv3x0F.png"},"episodes":[{"link":"32239","sourcePath":"/play/nanatsuiro-drops.tKBUA/cWS1p","sourceEpisodeNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":"Episodio 1","synopsis":"『世界で一番星に近い街』と呼ばれるのどかな街。\n\n石蕗正晴（つわぶきまさはる）はそんなのどかな街で普通の高校生活を送っていた。\n\nしかしある日、ひょんなことから名前も知らなかったクラスメイト・秋姫すももと友達の撫子（なでしこ）と一緒に園芸部を手伝わされることに。\n\nひと仕事を終えて、やれやれ…とジュースを飲もうとした時、怪しい男にぶつかった正晴は、ジュースが入れ替わっていることに気付かず飲み干してしまうが……","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9CQzd8FU71sla8Bx2yQmtVzBDWE.jpg","externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4884","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1688","episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1688","episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"92573","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"84027","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[1]}],"seasonNumber":1,"metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 1","synopsis":"『世界で一番星に近い街』と呼ばれるのどかな街。\n\n石蕗正晴（つわぶきまさはる）はそんなのどかな街で普通の高校生活を送っていた。\n\nしかしある日、ひょんなことから名前も知らなかったクラスメイト・秋姫すももと友達の撫子（なでしこ）と一緒に園芸部を手伝わされることに。\n\nひと仕事を終えて、やれやれ…とジュースを飲もうとした時、怪しい男にぶつかった正晴は、ジュースが入れ替わっていることに気付かず飲み干してしまうが……","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9CQzd8FU71sla8Bx2yQmtVzBDWE.jpg"}}},{"link":"32240","sourcePath":"/play/nanatsuiro-drops.tKBUA/2sKyH","sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"episodeNumber":2,"title":"Episodio 2","synopsis":"朝、目覚めると人間の姿に戻っていた正晴。\n\n変身は夢だったのだと思い込もうとするが、日が沈むとまたぬいぐるみに変身してしまう。\n\nショックを受ける正晴に如月先生は「日が昇ると人間に、日が暮れるとぬいぐるみに変身する」ことと「星のしずくをとるところを人に見られてはいけない」ということを教える。\n\nさっそくその夜もユキちゃんとしてすももと一緒に星のしずくをとりにいく正晴だったが……。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tAOa8oqlibSd61ayf9c9ZKaSnQA.jpg","externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4884","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1688","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1688","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"92573","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"84027","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"seasonNumber":1,"metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 2","synopsis":"朝、目覚めると人間の姿に戻っていた正晴。\n\n変身は夢だったのだと思い込もうとするが、日が沈むとまたぬいぐるみに変身してしまう。\n\nショックを受ける正晴に如月先生は「日が昇ると人間に、日が暮れるとぬいぐるみに変身する」ことと「星のしずくをとるところを人に見られてはいけない」ということを教える。\n\nさっそくその夜もユキちゃんとしてすももと一緒に星のしずくをとりにいく正晴だったが……。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tAOa8oqlibSd61ayf9c9ZKaSnQA.jpg"}}},{"link":"32241","sourcePath":"/play/nanatsuiro-drops.tKBUA/sck5R","sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"episodeNumber":3,"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"七夕も近づいた初夏の夜、いつものように星のしずくが落ちてくるのを待っているすももとユキちゃん。\n\nしかし、せっかく降ってきてもまだすももにはうまくつかまえられない。\n\nそこへ突然謎の少女・プリマアスパラスが現れ「星のしずくをとるライバル」だと宣言する。\n\n驚くすももだったが、アスパラスが次々に繰り出す魔法を使いまったくたちうちできない。\n\nそしてついにアスパラスに星のしずくをとられてしまい……。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aifH8NbPMZ6DhtKmPeeHWnpZA3B.jpg","externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4884","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1688","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1688","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"92573","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"84027","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"seasonNumber":1,"metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"七夕も近づいた初夏の夜、いつものように星のしずくが落ちてくるのを待っているすももとユキちゃん。\n\nしかし、せっかく降ってきてもまだすももにはうまくつかまえられない。\n\nそこへ突然謎の少女・プリマアスパラスが現れ「星のしずくをとるライバル」だと宣言する。\n\n驚くすももだったが、アスパラスが次々に繰り出す魔法を使いまったくたちうちできない。\n\nそしてついにアスパラスに星のしずくをとられてしまい……。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aifH8NbPMZ6DhtKmPeeHWnpZA3B.jpg"}}},{"link":"32242","sourcePath":"/play/nanatsuiro-drops.tKBUA/7sJ1d","sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"episodeNumber":4,"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"突然転校してきた結城ノナは、クラスメイトが話しかけてもほとんど無視して勉強し続けるようなクールな女の子だった。\n\nそして夏、プールの季節。\n\n水が苦手なすももはプールに入ることもできず、そんな自分に落ち込んでしまっている。\n\nその夜やってきた星のしずくは、なんとプールの中に飛び込んでしまう。\n\n身動きのできないすももの前にまたアスパラスが現れ、〝水と交わる〟呪文を教えるが、その呪文は水を怖がるものには使えないのだという……。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ijxI1hbO5iqYQ2tptH65QtOp5ff.jpg","externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4884","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1688","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1688","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"92573","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"84027","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"seasonNumber":1,"metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"突然転校してきた結城ノナは、クラスメイトが話しかけてもほとんど無視して勉強し続けるようなクールな女の子だった。\n\nそして夏、プールの季節。\n\n水が苦手なすももはプールに入ることもできず、そんな自分に落ち込んでしまっている。\n\nその夜やってきた星のしずくは、なんとプールの中に飛び込んでしまう。\n\n身動きのできないすももの前にまたアスパラスが現れ、〝水と交わる〟呪文を教えるが、その呪文は水を怖がるものには使えないのだという……。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ijxI1hbO5iqYQ2tptH65QtOp5ff.jpg"}}},{"link":"32243","sourcePath":"/play/nanatsuiro-drops.tKBUA/MSOpl","sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"episodeNumber":5,"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"二泊三日の臨海学校にやってきた正晴は、ぬいぐるみになってしまう夜をどう乗り越えようかと悩んでいた。\n\nそんな正晴の悩みをよそにそれぞれ楽しんでいるクラスメイト達。\n\n圭介の夜の誘いを体調が悪いとごまかしてなんとか切り抜け、ユキちゃん（になった正晴）はすももに会いに行くが、ちょうどお風呂に入ろうとしていたすももは、ユキちゃんを連れてお風呂に行こうとする。\n\n焦って逃げようとするユキちゃん（正晴）だが…!?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vagrhTgLzihpfD2ybThoah8ogTF.jpg","externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4884","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1688","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1688","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"92573","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"84027","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"seasonNumber":1,"metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"二泊三日の臨海学校にやってきた正晴は、ぬいぐるみになってしまう夜をどう乗り越えようかと悩んでいた。\n\nそんな正晴の悩みをよそにそれぞれ楽しんでいるクラスメイト達。\n\n圭介の夜の誘いを体調が悪いとごまかしてなんとか切り抜け、ユキちゃん（になった正晴）はすももに会いに行くが、ちょうどお風呂に入ろうとしていたすももは、ユキちゃんを連れてお風呂に行こうとする。\n\n焦って逃げようとするユキちゃん（正晴）だが…!?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vagrhTgLzihpfD2ybThoah8ogTF.jpg"}}},{"link":"32244","sourcePath":"/play/nanatsuiro-drops.tKBUA/ddled","sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"episodeNumber":6,"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"臨海学校ですももに好きな人がいると知った正晴は、如月先生と楽しそうに話すすももを見て、相手は如月先生かと落ち込んでしまう。\n\n一方、ノナは裏庭に正晴を呼び出し、肝試しでおんぶしてもらったことを口止めしようとしていた。\n\nそんなふたりを偶然見かけたすももの方も、正晴の好きな人はノナだと思い込んでしまう。\n\nお互いに気持ちを伝えられないすももと正晴だが、その夜、すももはユキちゃんになった正晴に入学式で出会った男の子のことを話し出す。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dXugQFVYsA4DxsuQelS65owiELO.jpg","externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4884","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1688","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1688","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"92573","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"84027","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"seasonNumber":1,"metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"臨海学校ですももに好きな人がいると知った正晴は、如月先生と楽しそうに話すすももを見て、相手は如月先生かと落ち込んでしまう。\n\n一方、ノナは裏庭に正晴を呼び出し、肝試しでおんぶしてもらったことを口止めしようとしていた。\n\nそんなふたりを偶然見かけたすももの方も、正晴の好きな人はノナだと思い込んでしまう。\n\nお互いに気持ちを伝えられないすももと正晴だが、その夜、すももはユキちゃんになった正晴に入学式で出会った男の子のことを話し出す。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dXugQFVYsA4DxsuQelS65owiELO.jpg"}}},{"link":"32245","sourcePath":"/play/nanatsuiro-drops.tKBUA/brD-Q","sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"episodeNumber":7,"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"すももに「好きだ」と告白した正晴だが、すももはどうすればいいのかわからず飛び出して行ってしまう。\n\nそれからというもの、すももと正晴は教室で目を合わすこともできなくなってしまった。\n\nそして、正晴は告白したことを後悔し始めるが…。\n\n一方、アスパラスは、すももが使った一瞬にして池を凍らせる技の出どころを調べようと躍起になっていた。\n\nそして、その技を使ったことのある伝説の少女をつきとめる。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oRrQ1fvEoUIkIisyfkhV54ZIFjJ.jpg","externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4884","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1688","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1688","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"92573","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"84027","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"seasonNumber":1,"metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"すももに「好きだ」と告白した正晴だが、すももはどうすればいいのかわからず飛び出して行ってしまう。\n\nそれからというもの、すももと正晴は教室で目を合わすこともできなくなってしまった。\n\nそして、正晴は告白したことを後悔し始めるが…。\n\n一方、アスパラスは、すももが使った一瞬にして池を凍らせる技の出どころを調べようと躍起になっていた。\n\nそして、その技を使ったことのある伝説の少女をつきとめる。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oRrQ1fvEoUIkIisyfkhV54ZIFjJ.jpg"}}},{"link":"32246","sourcePath":"/play/nanatsuiro-drops.tKBUA/xPXm7","sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"episodeNumber":8,"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"ついにお互いの気持ちがわかったすももと正晴。\n\nだが、お互いに今まで以上にどぎまぎしてまともに話もできなくなってしまった。\n\nそんな状況を見かねた圭介達が、すももから正晴をデートに誘うようけしかけてふたりはようやく初めてのデートにこぎつけるが…。\n\n一方、すももがカリンの娘だと知ったノナは、すももに負けまいと古い文献を読みあさり猛勉強をはじめていた。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kRzELQ3jmUDSIbUTHJJ448FvnE6.jpg","externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4884","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1688","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1688","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"92573","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"84027","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"seasonNumber":1,"metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"ついにお互いの気持ちがわかったすももと正晴。\n\nだが、お互いに今まで以上にどぎまぎしてまともに話もできなくなってしまった。\n\nそんな状況を見かねた圭介達が、すももから正晴をデートに誘うようけしかけてふたりはようやく初めてのデートにこぎつけるが…。\n\n一方、すももがカリンの娘だと知ったノナは、すももに負けまいと古い文献を読みあさり猛勉強をはじめていた。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kRzELQ3jmUDSIbUTHJJ448FvnE6.jpg"}}},{"link":"32247","sourcePath":"/play/nanatsuiro-drops.tKBUA/11rSJ","sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"episodeNumber":9,"title":"Episodio 9","synopsis":"正晴と気持ちが通じ合ったことで、スピニアとしての力も強くなっていくすもも。\n\n「ユキちゃんのために」と頑張るすももを見て、正晴は自分がユキちゃんであることをすももに隠していることに罪悪感を抱きはじめる。\n\n正晴は、打ち明けたい、と如月先生に相談するが、そんなことをしたらとりかえしのつかないことになると言われてしまう。\n\n一方、ノナは先日の対決以来ショックで学校を休んでいた。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qpHlW81hsIYYJrJLdlc6L4JerVC.jpg","externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4884","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1688","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1688","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"92573","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"84027","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"seasonNumber":1,"metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 9","synopsis":"正晴と気持ちが通じ合ったことで、スピニアとしての力も強くなっていくすもも。\n\n「ユキちゃんのために」と頑張るすももを見て、正晴は自分がユキちゃんであることをすももに隠していることに罪悪感を抱きはじめる。\n\n正晴は、打ち明けたい、と如月先生に相談するが、そんなことをしたらとりかえしのつかないことになると言われてしまう。\n\n一方、ノナは先日の対決以来ショックで学校を休んでいた。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qpHlW81hsIYYJrJLdlc6L4JerVC.jpg"}}},{"link":"32248","sourcePath":"/play/nanatsuiro-drops.tKBUA/OEvKY","sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"episodeNumber":10,"title":"Episodio 10","synopsis":"すももにユキが本当は自分であることを明かし、ぬいぐるみになってしまった正晴。\n\nすももはショックで泣き続けるが、如月先生と撫子の励ましで、正晴を自分の力で元に戻そうと決意する。\n\n学校では正晴は病気で入院しているとということにして、クラスメイトに明るく振舞おうとするすもも。\n\nだが、ノナは自分を責めようとしないすももを見て、いたたまれずに教室を立ち去ってしまう。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mWaC6hcfEpiR7dVL8TNQibqhDYS.jpg","externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4884","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1688","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1688","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"92573","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"84027","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"seasonNumber":1,"metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 10","synopsis":"すももにユキが本当は自分であることを明かし、ぬいぐるみになってしまった正晴。\n\nすももはショックで泣き続けるが、如月先生と撫子の励ましで、正晴を自分の力で元に戻そうと決意する。\n\n学校では正晴は病気で入院しているとということにして、クラスメイトに明るく振舞おうとするすもも。\n\nだが、ノナは自分を責めようとしないすももを見て、いたたまれずに教室を立ち去ってしまう。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mWaC6hcfEpiR7dVL8TNQibqhDYS.jpg"}}},{"link":"32249","sourcePath":"/play/nanatsuiro-drops.tKBUA/THQaC","sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"episodeNumber":11,"title":"Episodio 11","synopsis":"ぬいぐるみから人間に戻った正晴は、フィグラーレの力を直接体に受けた影響で記憶が混乱していた。\n\nこの状態でななつの星のしずくで作った薬を飲むと、正晴は完全に元の人間に戻れてもこの半年間の記憶を 失くしてしまうという。\n\nそんなこととは知らずに７つ目の星のしずくを待ち焦がれているすももを前に、 正晴はその事実を言い出せずにいたが…。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5hRCpPe9R8ZKJXRAWsT6YWEAT3u.jpg","externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4884","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1688","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1688","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"92573","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"84027","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"seasonNumber":1,"metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 11","synopsis":"ぬいぐるみから人間に戻った正晴は、フィグラーレの力を直接体に受けた影響で記憶が混乱していた。\n\nこの状態でななつの星のしずくで作った薬を飲むと、正晴は完全に元の人間に戻れてもこの半年間の記憶を 失くしてしまうという。\n\nそんなこととは知らずに７つ目の星のしずくを待ち焦がれているすももを前に、 正晴はその事実を言い出せずにいたが…。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5hRCpPe9R8ZKJXRAWsT6YWEAT3u.jpg"}}},{"link":"32250","sourcePath":"/play/nanatsuiro-drops.tKBUA/rYhHM","sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"episodeNumber":12,"title":"Episodio 12","synopsis":"すももと過ごした半年間の記憶を完全に失くした正晴は平凡な毎日を過ごしていたが、何か忘れているような感覚が離れない。\n\nしかし、まったく思い出せずすもものことにも無関心。\n\nすももはそんな正晴をせつなく見つめ、ふたりの思い出があるだけで幸せだと自分に言い聞かせていた。\n\nそんなある日、学校から帰った正晴は、自分の部屋のクローゼットの奥に〝ユキちゃん〟の衣装があるのを見つけ…。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6QdSnkFdv4QhBnVQAfluyokwcjD.jpg","externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4884","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1688","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1688","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"92573","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"84027","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"seasonNumber":1,"metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 12","synopsis":"すももと過ごした半年間の記憶を完全に失くした正晴は平凡な毎日を過ごしていたが、何か忘れているような感覚が離れない。\n\nしかし、まったく思い出せずすもものことにも無関心。\n\nすももはそんな正晴をせつなく見つめ、ふたりの思い出があるだけで幸せだと自分に言い聞かせていた。\n\nそんなある日、学校から帰った正晴は、自分の部屋のクローゼットの奥に〝ユキちゃん〟の衣装があるのを見つけ…。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6QdSnkFdv4QhBnVQAfluyokwcjD.jpg"}}}],"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-11-02T08:43:20Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:1688","mal:1688"],"imdbSource":"plexanibridge-v2","targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4884","scope":"R","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1688","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"1688","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"92573","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"84027","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}}]},"artworkInventory":{"logo":[{"source":"tmdb","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/orig